error: `[agents.Support]` moved into the code: give agent `Support` `settings AgentSettings(…)` (spec 8.5, decision 0060). `mode = "observe"` is `mode: AgentMode.Observe`; `audit_log`, `audit_format` and `audit_otlp` are `audit: Audit(file: "…", format: AuditFormat.JsonLines, otlp: true)`; `state` and `journal` are on by default, in `agents/Support/`. `kavach.toml` keeps only `[agents] folder`
